IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhousto
 n.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026-07.1415_Web-Graphic_Placeholder.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/wp-content/upload
 s/2026/05/2026-07.1415_Web-Graphic_Placeholder.jpg
UID:qnylZEmPoLL4fcPGFGdUz
SUMMARY:Semi-Finals Day 1
DTSTAMP:20260705T141838Z
DTSTART:20260714T123000Z
DESCRIPTION:Two wins away from glory\, and only two teams will get there. T
	he semifinals are where World Cup dreams live or die — and we’re watching 
	every breathless minute together. \nKickoff is at 2:00 p.m. Admission is f
	ree! \nCommunity Partners: Further enhancing programming\, Levy Park will 
	partner with local organizations to broaden community engagement\, includi
	ng collaborations with cultural groups and soccer-focused nonprofits. Levy
	 Park is seeking enthusiastic volunteers and community partner organizatio
	ns to help bring this festival to life. Volunteers will work directly alon
	gside our event team\, supporting booth operations and helping ensure ever
	y guest has an unforgettable experience. Email us to learn more about volu
	nteer opportunities. \nFood and Beverage Concessions: Enjoy a variety of f
	estival food fare\, beer and wine\, and non-alcoholic beverages from Coca-
	Cola. \nMerchandise: Event merchandise celebrating Houston\, Levy Park\, a
	nd the global soccer tournament will also be available for purchase. \nArt
	 Installations and Photo Opportunities: Commemorate the experience with a 
	photo tour of the park\, including life-sized soccer-themed photo backdrop
	s and a tournament bracket. Visit our soccer ball music box and turn the c
	rank for festive sounds.\n\nhttps://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/semifin
	als-1/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/semifinals-1/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT5H
END:VEVENT
